    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1072">

                <pb facs="1162" n="1066" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1066"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leger to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Republic of Haiti</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-16"><hi rendition="#italic">February 16,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: The news of the sad
                    accident which has befallen the <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> has deeply
                    touched me, and I beg leave to express my condolence and sympathy with the
                    families of the unfortunate victims. My Government can not fail to feel deep
                    concern on account of the loss which the United States have just
                    experienced.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. N. Leger.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
